WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
What if I told you you don't need to
carry on home schooling your children.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.540
"What?"

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.519
Not for English in any case, we know
that being at home has suddenly meant

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:13.020
that you've become professional cooks,
cleaners, teachers as well as continuing

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.000
with your day job.  We're taking your
child's English lessons online!

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:24.180
"Hi guys !" "Hi!". Virtual lessons are designed to provide the same progress as regular lessons in a fun and

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:27.800
productive manner. "I'm a stay at home student".

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.860
"That's great English".

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:34.620
There will be an element of interactive guided
learning before and after the class.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:38.670
"I really liked exercise 2". This is to
make sure your child gets the most out

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:42.570
of their online English learning
experience. The virtual lessons platform

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:49.040
is easy to use and safe. So what will your
child need. They'll need a laptop with

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:53.780
audio and video features. They'll need to
be in a suitably quiet place

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.620
with minimal distraction.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.040
boy screaming in background !

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.280
"How do  I mute?"

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.700
There's no way she's
gonna be learning English.  They'll also

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:04.520
need to have a good Wi-Fi connection

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.440
"Mummy I can't hear anything...!"

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.720
You really do not want to find yourself in

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:09.980
that situation.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:14.060
The platform we use will
allow your child to participate in pair work.

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:15.420
"What's it like to live in Paris?"

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.300
"Well now, It's raining."

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:18.980
And group work.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.540
That was very interesting"

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:21.400
"Shall we do it again?"

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:22.100
"It's a giraffe"

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:23.140
"It's' an elephant"

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:23.980
"It's called .."

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.400
Child protection is of the upmost important to us.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.640
We have very strict anti-bullying policies.

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:31.800
Along with other housekeeping rules.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:32.700
that you

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.760
can read about on our website.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.920
Learning online will build your child's confidence,

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.140
